# non-decision-localcode-activity root
library "Pol".

// F1 — a library with a concept-level `code is` (so localCodesCount > 0) BUT no
// Decision, that ALSO carries an Activity. The Activity is unclassifiable, so
// the library is NOT layer-splittable. Pre-F1 the `interface` split kind fired on
// localCodesCount alone and the FULL partition silently DROPPED the Activity. F1
// gates `interface` on a Decision being present, so this must route to `none`
// (per-CRL) which preserves ALL statements as one library.

concept "Adult Patient":
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `adult-18-or-older`.

activity "Refer to GI":
- request CPGServiceRequest.
